    <comment>Update to 0.34.2

- 0.34.2: remux HEVC into mp4/mov as hvc1 so Apple players accept what
  Save Video writes; API nodes gained Google Omni 1.1
- 0.34.1: API nodes only (WAN3-Prime, Recraft V4 styles, Google Veo 2
  node dropped)
- python-comfyui-workflow-templates floor raised to &gt;= 0.11.50,
  following upstream. Kept a floor, not the == requirements.txt writes:
  exact pins on the comfy* packages previously made comfyui
  uninstallable in Factory whenever one of them was updated alone.</comment>
